On August 18th, members of Delta Company will face the true horror of a ruthless
battle among the trees of a rubber plantation called Long Tân.

7
00:43:50,526 --> 00:43:56,526
They are barely a hundred.

8
00:50:06,315 --> 00:50:12,315
The enemy is a human wave ready to destroy them.

